    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hefuku odu mwanta Ahasuwenausi wamwinkeli mwadi Esita mutaŋa wamukwankunyi nawaYudeya Hamani. Modekayi niyena hakwinzana kwimana kumesu amwanta, muloŋa Esita wamuleja dehi chasemukayinindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta hakufumisha kumunu windi kazeya kindi kamutambulayi dehi Hamani, hakumwinka Modekayi. Esita hakumwinka Modekayi kuyula mutaŋa waHamani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esita hakuhosha cheŋi kumesu amwanta, hakudimbukila kunyenduyindi, hakumulembelela namadilu, nindi, Afumishi kutama kweliliyi kaAgagi Hamani, nimwafuukwiliyi kuyikoŋa aYudeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta hakumwolwela Esita nkimyi yawuru. Esita hakunyamuka, hakwimana kumesu amwanta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindi, Neyi mwanta natiyi kuwaha, neyi nawani wuselewakumesu indi, neyi chumichi chinaloŋa kumesu amwanta, neyi ami nimuwahikumesu indi, asoneki mukanda wakubalumuna chuma chafuukwiliyi kaAgagi Hamani mwana kaHamedata, chasonekeliyi nindi ajilumuni aYudeya adimu mawuloŋu amwanta ejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ochu nukutwesha ŋahi kutala kutamakwakayilawu antaŋa jami? Nukutwesha ŋahi kutala chakajilumunawu awusoku wami? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta Ahasuwenausi hakuyila amwadi Esita naka-Yudeya Modekayi, nindi, Talenu, namwinki dehi Esita mutaŋa waHamani, niyomweni anamukudiki dehi kumutondu, nanochu chakwatiliyi chikasahadi aYudeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yisonekelenu nawa aYudeya mwijina damwanta, mwejima mumunakeŋeli, mulamikuhu chilamiki nakazeya kamwanta; muloŋansona yakusoneka mwijina damwanta, yakulamika chilamiki nakazeyaka mwanta, kwosi muntu watweshaŋa kuyibalumunaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atambika niansoneki jamwanta hohenohu mukakweji kamuchisatu, yowu kakweji Sivani, hefuku daku damakumi ayedi nakasatu. Asonekelimwa yilejeliyi Modekayi mwejima, hiyakutemesha nikudi aYudeya, nikudiayilolu, nikudi anguvulu, nikudi atulamba amumawuloŋu, kufumisha kundiya nakushika kuEtiyopiya, mumawuloŋu nkulakaji namakumi ayedi natanu nayedi, wuloŋu nansona jawu, wuloŋu nansona jawu, muza nedimidawu, muza nedimi dawu, aYudeya niwena nansona yawu niidimi dawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi akwakwenda lufuchi, endelelaŋa hatuwalu twambala twamudi muwamwanta twasweja lufuchi, hiyakuya; mwanta wayila dehi nindi, Nyakalenu, yenu lufuchi. Lushimbi olu alushimuna nimuŋanda muShushani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Modekayi hakufuma mwadiŋiyi mwanta, navwali wuvwalu wawantani wawuzeeli niwutooka, nichibaŋula chawuru cheneni, nichikovwelu chakuluka chawanda wawuwahi washina niwawusombu. Mukala waShushani wudikuwa nikudikuwa, wuzaŋalala nikuzaŋalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AYudeya atiya nikumuchimato-o, azaŋalala nikuzaŋalala, aluŋa nikuluŋa; ayilemesha nikudiantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muma wuloŋu ejima nimunyikala yejima, kwonsu kwashi kili izu damwanta nilushimbi lwindi, aYudeya hiyakuzaŋalala, hiyakuluŋa, hiyakudya chawija chefuku dawu dadiwahi. Antu amunyuza yamwituŋa mavulu abalumukili kwikala aYudeya nawoma wawaYudeya wunayikwati dehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
